---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Init: make it yours" description="Configure independent mini-apps and export one portable specification with a complete copy-to-Codex handoff."><h1>Configure your app.</h1><p class="lede">Your agent prepares the environment in <a href="/ready">Get Ready</a>, then uses this specification to build and deploy. Editing this form saves a draft; it never deploys or grants new permissions.</p><div class="workbench"><form id="init-form"><fieldset><legend>Your starting point</legend><label>Apps<select name="preset"><option value="composition">Guestbook + Showcase</option><option value="guestbook">Photo Guestbook</option><option value="showcase">Curated Showcase</option><option value="hello">Hello World reference</option></select></label><label>Title<input name="title" required maxlength="80" value="Our corner"/></label><label>Introduction<textarea name="intro" maxlength="240">A shared collection of moments worth keeping.</textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Appearance</legend><label>Theme<select name="theme"><option value="daylight">Daylight</option><option value="midnight">Midnight</option></select></label><label>Layout<select name="layout"><option value="grid">Gallery grid</option><option value="editorial">Larger editorial images</option></select></label></fieldset><fieldset id="privacy"><legend>Publication</legend><p>Submitted photos stay private until the owner approves them. Hiding a contribution removes its controlled media and featured cards.</p><span class="badge">Review first · supported safe default</span></fieldset><fieldset id="cards-field"><legend>Your curated links</legend><p class="small">Optional manual cards. Linked photos use the live provider contract.</p><div id="card-rows"></div><button type="button" class="secondary" id="add-card">Add a card</button></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Deployment intent</legend><label>Destination<select name="target"><option value="preview">A temporary Cloudflare address</option><option value="existing-domain">An existing domain</option><option value="new-domain">Explore a new domain</option></select></label><label id="hostname-label" hidden>Hostname<input name="hostname" placeholder="app.example.com" maxlength="253"/></label><p id="target-help" class="small">The agent verifies the actual account and toolchain before deployment.</p></fieldset><div class="actions"><button>Save and preview</button><button type="button" id="reset" class="secondary">Start a fresh draft</button></div><label>Import a saved spec<input id="import" type="file" accept="application/json"/></label><p role="status" aria-live="polite" id="message" class="message"></p></form><aside class="sticky"><div class="ink"><h2 id="preview-title">Our corner</h2><p id="preview-intro" class="lede">A shared collection of moments worth keeping.</p><p id="preview-apps">Guestbook + Showcase</p><p>Source independence, review before publication and validated updates are part of this supported path.</p></div><details open><summary>Portable specification</summary><pre id="spec"></pre></details><div class="actions"><button id="download" class="secondary">Download spec</button><button id="copy">Copy to Codex</button></div><details><summary>Read the agent handoff</summary><pre id="prompt"></pre></details><p class="small">No credentials go into this spec. A copied prompt is a handoff, not proof that an agent executed it.</p></aside></div><script src="../lib/init-client.ts"></script></Base>
